# Content cards

A corpus fixture exercising the reader-content blocks that render
structurally on native (A-04 / BR-APP-7): product-card, chart, row,
info-card, and diagram. Before A-04 these degraded to a markdown
string on native; this fixture pins the structural native projection.

::product-card[badge="Popular" badge-color="green"]
